  "💡 實務技巧：特教生回原班最需要家庭生活實踐與正向肯定，小單可直接貼在學生聯絡簿！": "💡 Practical tips: Special education students need most family life practice and positive affirmation when returning to their original class. The small order can be directly posted in the student contact book!",
