  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「⟦0⟧」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answer of \"⟦0⟧\" and the required prompts, and change another question to check the migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「1 公斤 250 公克可以寫成多少公克？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required tips for \"How many grams can 1 kilogram and 250 grams be written as?\" and change another question to check migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「1.3 的 3 在哪一位？代表多少？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required tips for \"Where is the 3 in 1.3? How much does it represent?\" and change another question to check the migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「2/5 ＋ 1/5 是多少？為什麼分母還是 5？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required prompts for \"What is 2/5 + 1/5? Why is the denominator still 5?\" and change another question to check migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「84 ÷ 4 的商為何是 21？商的 2 在哪個位置？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required tips for \"Why is the quotient of 84 ÷ 4 21? Where is the quotient of 2?\" and change another question to check migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「下午 3 時用 24 時制如何表示？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required prompts for \"How do you express 3 p.m. using the 24-hour clock?\" and change another question to check the migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「如果 □ × 4＝24，要怎麼找出方框？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required tips for \"If □ × 4=24, how to find the box?\" and change another question to check migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「要找星期二的故事書本數，手指要移到哪裡？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required prompts for \"To find the number of story books on Tuesday, where should I move my finger?\" and change another question to check the migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「第一步算什麼？每盤幾塊？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required tips for \"What is the first step? How much per plate?\" and change another question to check the migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「這串圖形接下來是什麼？一組有幾個？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required prompts for \"What comes next in this series of graphics? How many are in a group?\" and change another question to check migration.",
  "以操作、指認或口述蒐集表現。觀察「換成兩列以後，面積有沒有變？」的回答及所需提示，另換一題檢查遷移。": "Collect performance through operation, identification or utterance. Observe the answers and required prompts for \"Has the area changed after changing to two columns?\", and change another question to check the migration.",
