  "用符號說明並檢查": "Explain with symbols and check",
  "用等大的小方片蓋住兩張卡片，比一比哪張蓋得多。": "Use small square pieces of equal size to cover two cards and compare which one covers the most.",
  "用等大的分數紙條、分數圖卡、分數盤重做先備題，每次只示範一步，再請學生用自己的方式指出結果。": "Use fraction paper slips, fraction charts, and fraction disks of equal size to redo the preparatory questions. Demonstrate only one step at a time, and then ask students to point out the results in their own way.",
  "用等大的方片無重疊、無空隙地鋪滿圖形。": "Use square pieces of equal size to cover the shape without overlap or gaps.",
  "用等大的方片無重疊、無空隙地鋪滿圖形。 → 在圖上逐列點算整格，把兩個半格拼成一格。 → 以平方公分記錄；遇到不規則邊緣，說明如何估算。": "Use square pieces of equal size to cover the shape without overlap or gaps. → Count the whole grids column by column on the picture and assemble the two half grids into one grid. → Record in square centimeters; when encountering irregular edges, explain how to estimate.",
  "用等量分組盤、關係卡、算式磁鐵重做先備題，每次只示範一步，再請學生用自己的方式指出結果。": "Use equal grouping plates, relationship cards, and calculation magnets to redo the preparatory questions. Demonstrate only one step at a time, and then ask students to point out the results in their own way.",
  "用量杯注水：1000毫升是1公升": "Fill the measuring cup with water: 1000 ml is 1 liter",
  "用量杯裝到1公升": "Use measuring cup to fill to 1 liter",
  "用圖卡排出「圓、圓、方、圓、圓、方」，框住最短重複的一組。": "Use picture cards to arrange \"circle, circle, square, circle, circle, square\" and frame the shortest repeated group.",
  "用圖形排規律": "Arrange patterns graphically",
  "用圖數取了幾個相同的單位分數。": "Use the graph number to take several identical unit fractions.",
  "用課程表、分類卡、空白方格表重做先備題，每次只示範一步，再請學生用自己的方式指出結果。": "Use the curriculum, classification cards, and blank grids to redo the preparatory questions, demonstrate only one step at a time, and then ask students to point out the results in their own way.",
  "用操作、口述或指認向同伴說明做法。": "Explain how to do something to your peers by operating, speaking or pointing.",
  "用積木、形狀圖卡、數卡重做先備題，每次只示範一步，再請學生用自己的方式指出結果。": "Use building blocks, shape cards, and number cards to prepare the questions again. Only demonstrate one step at a time, and then ask students to point out the results in their own way.",
  "用積木分各個位值；不夠分時，把 1 個高位單位換成 10 個低位單位。": "Use building blocks to divide each place value; if it is not enough, replace 1 high-order unit with 10 low-order units.",
  "用積木分各個位值；不夠分時，把 1 個高位單位換成 10 個低位單位。 → 在位值格上從高位開始記商，做一次乘、減，再帶下下一位。 → 以除數 × 商 ＋ 餘數驗算，並確認餘數小於除數。": "Use building blocks to divide each place value; if it is not enough, replace 1 high-order unit with 10 low-order units. → Start recording the quotient from the high digit in the place value grid, do one multiplication and subtraction, and then bring up the next digit. → Check the calculation with divisor × quotient + remainder, and confirm that the remainder is smaller than the divisor.",
  "用錢幣和位值表，讀出並比較 10000 以內的數。": "Using money and place value tables, read and compare numbers up to 10,000.",
  "用歸零的秤、1 公斤參考物、公克標籤重做先備題，每次只示範一步，再請學生用自己的方式指出結果。": "Use a scale that has been reset to zero, a 1kg reference object, and a gram label to redo the preparatory questions. Only demonstrate one step at a time, and then ask students to point out the results in their own way.",
  "由等量分組連結乘除互逆，驗算並求未知的因數、被除數或除數。": "By combining multiplication and division reciprocity with equivalent groups, check and find unknown factors, dividends or divisors.",
