  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能⟦0⟧，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, be able to ⟦0⟧ and state or point out a basis for solving problems.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能用十分位表示量，比較一位小數，將位值對齊做加減，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, be able to express quantities with tenths, compare one decimal place, align place values ​​to add and subtract, and state or point out a basis for solving problems.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能用平方公分方格點算面積，觀察拼湊前後面積保留，估算不規則圖形，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, students can calculate the area using a square centimeter grid, observe the area retention before and after piecing together, estimate irregular shapes, and state or point out a basis for solving the problem.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能用位值理解除法直式，依題意處理餘數，並以接近的整十或整百數估商，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations designated by the teacher, students can use place value to understand direct division formulas, handle remainders according to the meaning of the problem, estimate quotients with nearest whole tens or whole hundreds, and state or point out a basis for solving the problem.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能用兩條算式處理連乘、倍數、加與除及減與除的生活問題，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations designated by the teacher, students can use two calculation formulas to solve life problems of continuous multiplication, multiples, addition and division, and subtraction and division, and state or point out a basis for solving the problem.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能用相同大小的整體累加單位分數，解決同分母分數的比較、加減與應用，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, students can use whole units of the same size to accumulate unit fractions, solve the comparison, addition, subtraction and application of fractions with the same denominator, and state or point out a basis for solving the problem.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能由等量分組連結乘除互逆，驗算並求未知的因數、被除數或除數，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, students can connect multiplication, division and reciprocity by equal groups, check and find unknown factors, dividends or divisors, and state or point out a basis for solving the problem.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能從生活、圖形及數列找出重複的一組或每次的變化，預測並說明下一項，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations designated by the teacher, students can identify repeated groups or changes each time from life, graphics and numerical sequences, predict and explain the next item, and state or point out a basis for solving problems.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能從列標題與欄標題找資料，把生活記錄整理成一維或二維表格，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, students can find information from column titles and column headings, organize life records into one-dimensional or two-dimensional tables, and state or point out a basis for solving problems.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能報讀 24 時制，換算日、時、分、秒，計算簡單的經過時間，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, students can read the 24-hour clock, convert days, hours, minutes and seconds, calculate simple elapsed time, and state or point out a basis for solving problems.",
  "在教師指定的圖像或操作支持下，能讀秤、估測與實測重量，以 1 公斤＝1000 公克換算、比較及計算，並說出或指出一個解題依據。": "With the support of images or operations specified by the teacher, be able to read scales, estimate and measured weights, convert, compare and calculate based on 1 kilogram = 1000 grams, and state or point out a basis for solving problems.",
  "在電腦與手機瀏覽器檢查答案、操作、字級及鍵盤互動，再以 Git 版本控制保存修改。": "Check answers, actions, font sizes, and keyboard interactions on computer and mobile browsers, then save changes with Git version control.",
  "在圖上逐列點算整格，把兩個半格拼成一格。": "Count the whole grids column by column on the picture and put the two half grids into one grid.",
  "在閱讀紀錄表上找「星期二」一列與「故事書」一欄，讀出交會格。": "Look for the \"Tuesday\" column and the \"Storybook\" column on the reading record sheet and read out the overlapping grid.",
