  "第 1 步【個位】：個位": "Step 1 [Ones digit]: Ones digit",
  "第 1 步【個位】：個位 ⟦0⟧ 不夠減 ⟦1⟧，向前借位。個位變成 ⟦2⟧，⟦3⟧ 減 ⟦4⟧ ＝ ⟦5⟧。個位寫 ⟦6⟧！": "Step 1 [Ones digit]: The ones digit ⟦0⟧ is not enough to subtract ⟦1⟧, so borrow forward. The ones digit becomes ⟦2⟧, ⟦3⟧ minus ⟦4⟧ = ⟦5⟧. Write ⟦6⟧ in the units digit!",
  "第 1 步【個位】：個位 ⟦0⟧ 減 ⟦1⟧ ＝ ⟦2⟧。個位寫 ⟦3⟧！": "Step 1 [Ones digit]: Ones digit ⟦0⟧ minus ⟦1⟧ = ⟦2⟧. Write ⟦3⟧ for the ones digit!",
  "第 1 題": "Question 1",
  "第 2 步【十位】：十位": "Step 2 [Tens place]: Tens place",
  "第 2 步【十位】：十位 ⟦0⟧ 減 ⟦1⟧ ＝ ⟦2⟧。十位寫 ⟦3⟧！": "Step 2 [Tens place]: Tens place ⟦0⟧ minus ⟦1⟧ = ⟦2⟧. For tens, write ⟦3⟧!",
  "第 2 步【十位】：十位退位後剩": "Step 2 [Ten]: After the tenth digit abdicates, the remaining",
  "第 2 步【十位】：十位退位後剩 ⟦0⟧ 不夠減 ⟦1⟧，向百位借 1 當 10，十位變成 ⟦2⟧。減去 ⟦3⟧ ＝ ⟦4⟧。十位寫 ⟦5⟧！": "Step 2 [Tens place]: After the tens place abdicates, the remaining ⟦0⟧ is not enough to subtract ⟦1⟧. Borrow 1 from the hundreds place as 10, and the tens place becomes ⟦2⟧. Subtract ⟦3⟧ = ⟦4⟧. For tens, write ⟦5⟧!",
  "第 3 步【百位】：百位": "Step 3 [Hundreds Place]: Hundreds Place",
  "第 3 步【百位】：百位 ⟦0⟧ 減 ⟦1⟧ ＝ ⟦2⟧。百位寫 ⟦3⟧！": "Step 3 [Hundreds place]: Hundreds place ⟦0⟧ minus ⟦1⟧ = ⟦2⟧. For hundreds, write ⟦3⟧!",
  "第 3 步【百位】：百位借位後剩": "Step 3 [Hundreds Place]: The hundreds place is borrowed and left",
  "第 3 步【百位】：百位借位後剩 ⟦0⟧ 不夠減 ⟦1⟧，向千位借 1 當 10。百位變成 ⟦2⟧，減去 ⟦3⟧ ＝ ⟦4⟧。百位寫 ⟦5⟧！": "Step 3 [Hundreds place]: After borrowing the hundreds place, the remaining ⟦0⟧ is not enough to subtract ⟦1⟧, so borrow 1 from the thousands place and treat it as 10. The hundreds place becomes ⟦2⟧, subtract ⟦3⟧ = ⟦4⟧. For hundreds, write ⟦5⟧!",
  "第 4 步【千位】：千位剩下": "Step 4 [Thousands Place]: Thousands Place Remaining",
  "第 4 步【千位】：千位剩下 ⟦0⟧ 減 ⟦1⟧ ＝ ⟦2⟧。千位寫 ⟦3⟧！完整答案是 ⟦4⟧！": "Step 4 [Thousands place]: The remaining thousands place is ⟦0⟧ minus ⟦1⟧ = ⟦2⟧. Write ⟦3⟧ for thousands! The complete answer is ⟦4⟧!",
  "第⟦2⟧組": "Group ⟦2⟧",
  "第一步，先算十位積木塊。": "The first step is to count the tens building blocks.",
  "第一步，先算十位積木塊。⟦0⟧ 乘以 ⟦1⟧ 等於 ⟦2⟧。": "The first step is to count the tens building blocks. ⟦0⟧ times ⟦1⟧ equals ⟦2⟧.",
  "第一步：先看右邊黃色「個位欄」，把上下兩個數字加起來！": "Step 1: First look at the yellow \"ones column\" on the right and add up the upper and lower numbers!",
  "第一步：先看右邊黃色「個位欄」，算算看": "Step 1: First look at the yellow \"one column\" on the right and do the math.",
  "第一步：先看右邊黃色「個位欄」，算算看 ⟦0⟧ ＋ ⟦1⟧ ＝ 多少？": "Step 1: First look at the yellow \"ones column\" on the right, and calculate how much ⟦0⟧ + ⟦1⟧ =?",
  "第一步：計算左邊藍色十位積木！": "Step one: Calculate the blue tens building block on the left!",
  "第一步：計算左邊藍色十位積木！⟦0⟧ × ⟦1⟧ ＝": "Step one: Calculate the blue tens building block on the left! ⟦0⟧ × ⟦1⟧ =",
