  "第一單元 · 看圖 → 動手 → 讀數": "Unit 1 · Look at pictures → Hands-on → Reading",
  "第二步，再算個位小塊。": "The second step is to count the individual bits.",
  "第二步，再算個位小塊。⟦0⟧ 乘以 ⟦1⟧ 等於 ⟦2⟧。": "The second step is to count the individual bits. ⟦0⟧ times ⟦1⟧ equals ⟦2⟧.",
  "第二步：再算藍色「十位欄」": "Step 2: Calculate the blue \"tens column\" again",
  "第二步：再算藍色「十位欄」 ⟦0⟧ ＋ ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧": "Step 2: Calculate the blue \"tens column\" ⟦0⟧ + ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧",
  "第二步：計算右邊黃色個位小塊！": "Step 2: Calculate the small yellow single digit block on the right!",
  "第二步：計算右邊黃色個位小塊！⟦0⟧ × ⟦1⟧ ＝": "Step 2: Calculate the small yellow single digit block on the right! ⟦0⟧ × ⟦1⟧ =",
  "第三步，把兩部分合體加起來。": "The third step is to add the two parts together.",
  "第三步，把兩部分合體加起來。⟦0⟧ 加 ⟦1⟧ 等於 ⟦2⟧。兩部分已合起來，請對照圖形再說一次。": "The third step is to add the two parts together. ⟦0⟧ plus ⟦1⟧ equals ⟦2⟧. The two parts have been combined. Please compare it with the graphics and say it again.",
  "第三步：把十位乘積與個位乘積加起來！": "Step 3: Add the tens product and the ones product!",
  "第三步：把十位乘積與個位乘積加起來！⟦0⟧ ＋ ⟦1⟧ ＝": "Step 3: Add the tens product and the ones product! ⟦0⟧ ＋ ⟦1⟧ ＝",
  "第三步：最後算綠色「百位欄」，完成後按「✅ 檢查答案」！": "Step 3: Finally calculate the green \"hundreds column\" and click \"✅ Check Answer\" after completion!",
