  "適用南一三下十單元。可用於課前暖身、課中操作、兩人合作與課後練習。建議一人操作、一人解釋，再交換角色。3D 地圖負責探索，數學操作面板亦可獨立使用；每次進入先到登島碼頭選島，再沿登島橋與十三座連島橋慢慢前往。選島後，電腦畫面左側三分之一為地圖，右側三分之二為解題區；手機則依序呈現。電腦可使用方向鍵／WASD，平板可按方向鈕；點地面或島名可自動沿可通行路線前往。": "Applicable to south one three and ten units. It can be used for warm-up before class, operation during class, two-person cooperation and after-class practice. It is recommended that one person operates, one person explains, and then the roles are swapped. The 3D map is responsible for exploration, and the mathematical operation panel can also be used independently. Each time you enter, go to the island landing pier to select an island, and then slowly go along the island landing bridge and the thirteen island-connecting bridges. After selecting an island, the left third of the computer screen is the map and the right two thirds is the problem solving area; the mobile phone displays them in sequence. You can use the direction keys/WASD on computers and press the direction buttons on tablets; click on the ground or the name of the island to automatically follow the accessible route.",
