  "讓三角板的直角頂點對準紅點，一邊貼齊藍邊。按「蓋上三角板」，再看另一邊。": "Align the right-angled vertex of the triangular plate with the red dot and one side with the blue edge. Click \"Cover Triangle\" and look at the other side.",
  "讓學生完成一個任務或其中一個步驟，再請他連回今天的解題方法；不要求五分鐘完成整座島。": "Let the student complete one mission or one step, then connect it to today's method. Completing a whole island in five minutes is not required.",
  "讓學習更舒服": "Make studying more comfortable",
  "觀察一次操作及一次說明；不只看最後答案。尚未理解時保留材料，縮小數值或減少步驟。": "Observe one action and one explanation, not just the final answer. If understanding is not secure, keep materials available and reduce the numbers or steps.",
  "觀察任務操作、關鍵步驟及求助情形；證書與完成進度作為鼓勵，另以實際表現確認理解。": "Observe mission actions, key steps, and requests for help. Certificates and progress encourage participation; confirm understanding through actual performance.",
  "觀察每位學生是否參與及能否說明方法；團隊分數與搶答速度不當作個人概念達成標準。": "Observe whether each student participates and can explain a method. Team points and response speed do not establish individual conceptual mastery.",
